0..78 Comment "//! What a kept view may not do: a view no region keeps escapes its access, an"
79..157 Comment "//! exclusive view is kept nowhere, a held value a live region keeps a view of"
158..238 Comment "//! is not written, and nothing kept in a region leaves it, whether a capability"
239..319 Comment "//! scope or a hold opened the region. A region is a static extent erased before"
320..386 Comment "//! anything runs [Koronkevich-2025-type_universes_kripke_worlds]."
